    description: "Repro: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/audit/probe4_electron has ipcMain.handle('ping', ...); no event_handler entry is produced, on dev or on the entry-kind branch. The electron.yaml ipc_handler rows that claimed it were call-keyed decorator rows and never fired; the entry-kind PR removes them. No usage shape for ipcMain.handle exists in js_ts. The IPC linker does see these calls (it links channels); an entry would come from there or from a usage row.\n\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr7/jilik/ (RESULTS.md, sweep/). Found while building WI-jilik (entry-kind PR, 2026-11-21)."  # eaaa
